        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"language\": {\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"description\": \"The main language used on the website, such as English or Hindi.\"\n  },\n  \"brandTone\": {\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"description\": \"The tone of voice used by the brand on their website, e.g., friendly, professional, energetic, premium, etc.\"\n  },\n  \"brandValues\": {\n    \"type\": \"array\",\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"description\": \"The values or ethos emphasized by the brand, such as community, sustainability, handcrafted quality, local sourcing, etc.\"\n  },\n  \"productCategories\": {\n    \"type\": \"array\",\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"description\": \"The types of products offered by the brand, such as coffee, food, merchandise, etc.\"\n  },\n  \"customerFocus\": {\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"description\": \"The target customer segment the brand focuses on, e.g., young adults, busy professionals, coffee lovers, etc.\"\n  }\n}\n",
        "options": {
          "systemPromptTemplate": "=You are analyzing text scraped from a coffee brand's website. Extract the following details based on the content:\n\n1. **Language**: What is the main language used on the website?\n2. **Brand Tone of Voice**: Describe the brand's tone (e.g., friendly, premium, professional, fun, passionate).\n3. **Values and Ethos**: What values or beliefs does the brand emphasize? (e.g., sustainability, community, handcrafted quality)\n4. **Product Categories**: What main product types does the brand offer?\n5. **Customer Focus**: What type of customer does the brand seem to target? Mention age group, lifestyle, interests, or values if mentioned or implied.\n\nFormat your response as a structured JSON object with clear keys for each point.\n"
