    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Here is the 3-part email follow-up sequence:\n\nEmail 1: A Drop of Calm for Your Menu\nSubject: Add a Little Chill to Your Lattes\nHi {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json['Business name'] }},\n{We love {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json['Business name'] }}'s vibe. Your emphasis on plant-based wellness and\ncreating a calming customer experience really stood out. We felt an instant kinship.}\nI’m reaching out from Goldmine Adaptogens - a California-based, woman-owned\nwellness brand on a mission to help people feel better, naturally. At Goldmine, our\nbestselling bulk tincture, Golden Drops, is a barista-friendly blend of organic adaptogens\nthat stirs into anything (yes, even espresso) without messing with your menu's flavor.\nThink: calm energy, immunity support, and earthy magic your regulars at {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json['Business name'] }} will love.\n{Golden Drops could be a seamless fit for your wellness-forward menu and vibe.}\nWant to peek at the ingredients or try a sample?\nWarmly,\nBob from Goldmine\n\nEmail 2: Cafés Like Yours Are Loving This\nSubject: What other cafés are saying about Golden Drops\nHey {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json['Business name'] }},\n{Your commitment to wellness and education at {prospect company name} really caught\nour attention-your space feels like more than just a café, it feels like a place for mindful\nmoments.}\nGoldmine Adaptogens has been sending samples of Golden Drops to cafés like\n{{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json['Business name'] }}, and here’s what we’ve heard:\n\"It blends into everything, and our customers actually ask for it by name now.\"\n☕️\n\"Perfect for our wellness-forward vibe - and no prep headaches.\"\nWith stress support, focus perks, and ingredients like fruiting-body mushrooms and\nashwagandha, it’s the quiet superpower your drinks didn’t know they needed.\n{We think your guests at {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json['Business name'] }} would be genuinely excited to see\nsomething like Golden Drops on your menu.}\nLet me know where to send your sample—no strings, just herbs.\nBest,\nBob\n\nEmail 3: Just a Soft Nudge\nSubject: A quick check-in + sample?\nHi {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json['Business name'] }},\n{Everything about {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json['Business name'] }} - from your community-first focus to your\nthoughtful beverage curation - tells us you really care about what you serve and why.}\nI wanted to check in on behalf of Goldmine Adaptogens in case you’re still curious - we’d\nlove to send you a Golden Drops sample to try—no strings attached.\n{If Golden Drops can support your mission and your guests at ,\n{{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json['Business name'] }}we’d love to explore it together.}\nNo pressure. Just good vibes, great herbs, and a shot at making your customers feel\namazing.\nAll the best,\nBob\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a B2B marketer crafting a highly personalized outreach email to a coffee brand. \n\nUsed this card information to create customised outreach email.\n\n1)Comapany profile card:\nBrand-Goldmine Adaptogen.\nMission- promote wellness through adaptogen.\nMessaging pillar-Modern herbalism, clean ingredient, daily rituals.\n\n2)Product card:\nProduct-golden drop,\nkey feature-Bulk format, neutral taste, support stress relief.\nTarget use: latte, tea, smoothies in cafe environment.\n\n3)prospect profile card:\nTarget audience-Independent coffee shop owner and managers.\nMotivations: wellness-focused menu upgrades, easy implementation, natural branding.\n\nused this data to match the recepient langauge and positioning.\n\nThe recipient coffee shop's brand details are:\n- Language: {{ $json['Extract information'].Language }}\n- Brand Tone:{{ $json['Extract information']['Brand Tone of Voice'] }}\n- Values and Ethos: {{ $json['Extract information']['Values and Ethos'] }}\n- Product Categories: {{ $json['Extract information']['Product Categories'] }}\n- Customer Focus: {{ $json['Extract information']['Customer Focus'] }}\n\n\nWrite a 3 follow up short, smart, and personalized email that matches the recipient’s tone of voice and brand language.  \n- Make sure to highlight how the product aligns with their values, customer focus, and current offerings.  \n- Keep the tone human, sincere, and aligned with their branding.  \n- Your goal is to create a natural and trust-building connection that sparks interest.  \n- Close the email with a clear call to action (e.g., sample, chat, collab) without sounding pushy.\n.\nAlso make sure whereever I have mention the business name in prompt section email templete it need to be visible in personalised email output.\n\nused \nstrutured output parser: for the strcutured email output in 3 field 'Email 1', 'Email 2', 'Email 3'\n{\n  \"Email 1\": \"\",\n  \"Email 2\": \"\",\n  \"Email 3\": \"\"\n}\n\nGive the 3-part follow up email \n\nKeep the message under 150 words. Output only the final email content, no commentary.\n"
        }
      },
